<release version="0.2.1" date="2026-11-04">
  <description>
    <ul>
      <li>Add Crc32Ieee and Adler32 checksums.</li>
      <li>Fix Sha256 move assignment.</li>
      <li>Add completion transports to tls::Connector and Acceptor.</li>
      <li>Give TLS stream failures single ownership.</li>
      <li>Update rstd to 0.1.11.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
</release>
<release version="0.2.0" date="2026-10-30">
  <description>
    <ul>
      <li>Add an optional OpenSSL backend.</li>
      <li>Return CryptoResult from digest operations.</li>
      <li>Add tls::Session and tls::Stream.</li>
      <li>Support client identities and hostname verification options.</li>
      <li>Add tls::CloseMode.</li>
      <li>Fix TLS shutdown progress.</li>
      <li>Update rstd to 0.1.10.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
</release>
